{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="An integrative practice for practical, humane care that helps you set a steady, personalized course.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <div class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
    </div>
    <nav class="main-nav">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Symptoms &amp; Signals</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
      <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="cta">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero split-diagonal">
      <div class="panel left">
        <h1>Quietly reweaving the parts into your life.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A practical, layered approach to help you notice what matters and shape small, steady decisions that add up. Educational care and collaborative planning — no promises of cure, just clear, supportive steps.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="book.html" class="btn primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a href="#session-planner" class="btn ghost">Start a quick plan</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="contact-inline">
          <li>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></li>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
          <li>Serving: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel right">
        <div class="pattern-wrap" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="snapshot">
          <h3>Session snapshot</h3>
          <p>Start with an intake-focused consultation, move to coordinated follow-ups, and land in a practical rhythm of home practices and brief check-ins.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="what-to-expect" class="what-expect">
      <h2>What to expect</h2>
      <p class="intro">A short arc: orient — prioritize — practice. We'll gather what matters, sketch a plan you can try, and set simple follow-up so it can stick.</p>

      <div class="inventory">
        <h3>Whole-person inventory</h3>
        <p class="muted">Tick the areas you want to explore. We'll offer an agenda and a follow-up cadence based on your selections.</p>
        <form id="inventory-form">
          <div class="areas">
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Sleep"> Sleep &amp; rest</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Nutrition"> Nutrition &amp; appetite</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Movement"> Movement &amp; strength</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Stress"> Stress &amp; resilience</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Digestion"> Digestion &amp; gut</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Mood"> Mood &amp; focus</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Relationships"> Relationships &amp; support</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Work"> Work &amp; rhythm</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Environment"> Environment &amp; routines</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="Spiritual"> Meaning &amp; values</label>
          </div>
          <div class="inventory-actions">
            <button type="button" id="inventory-generate" class="btn">Generate agenda & cadence</button>
            <button type="button" id="inventory-copy" class="btn ghost" disabled>Copy summary</button>
          </div>
        </form>
        <pre id="inventory-output" class="output" aria-live="polite"></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="gallery">
      <h2>Practical paths we offer</h2>
      <p class="muted">Programs and sessions framed as courses of action rather than labels.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <h4>Foundations Session</h4>
          <p>60-minute entry visit to build a practical intake and a first-week plan.</p>
          <div class="price">Starting at $150</div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h4>Guided Mini-Track</h4>
          <p>A focused 4-week sequence with targeted check-ins and home practices.</p>
          <div class="price">Packages from $420</div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h4>Maintenance Check</h4>
          <p>Brief 25-minute follow-up to revise and reharmonize what's working.</p>
          <div class="price">$65 / session</div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="objections">
      <h2>Questions that come up</h2>
      <div class="qas">
        <div class="qa">
          <h5>Is this medical care?</h5>
          <p class="ans">We offer integrative, educational services—informative support and practical plans. Not emergency care; we work alongside your other providers and make referrals when needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <h5>Can I expect a cure?</h5>
          <p class="ans">There are no guarantees. Our focus is on clarifying options, making small sustainable changes, and tracking what shifts. We design steps that you can test and adapt.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <h5>How long until I notice change?</h5>
          <p class="ans">People notice different signals at different times. We'll outline near-term practices (days), short-term markers (weeks), and maintenance plans (months).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="session-planner" class="planner">
      <h2>Session Planner</h2>
      <p class="muted">Create a tailored short plan. Export a plaintext summary to save or share.</p>
      <form id="planner-form">
        <label>
          Preferred pace
          <select name="pace" id="pace">
            <option value="concise">Concise—focused intake (30–45m)</option>
            <option value="standard" selected>Standard—full intake (60m)</option>
            <option value="deep">Deep—extended consult (90m)</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <label>
          Number of follow-ups
          <input type="number" id="followups" name="followups" min="0" max="12" value="3">
        </label>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Focus areas (choose up to 4)</legend>
          <div class="areas-grid">
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="Sleep"> Sleep</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="Nutrition"> Nutrition</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="Movement"> Movement</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="Stress"> Stress</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="Digestion"> Digestion</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="Mood"> Mood &amp; cognition</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="Energy"> Energy rhythms</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="Habits"> Habits &amp; routines</label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <label>
          Notes (goals or context)
          <textarea id="planner-notes" rows="3" placeholder="A few sentences about priorities or what led you here."></textarea>
        </label>

        <div class="planner-actions">
          <button type="button" id="planner-build" class="btn primary">Build my plan</button>
          <button type="button" id="planner-copy" class="btn ghost" disabled>Copy plan</button>
          <a href="book.html" class="btn">Book a session</a>
        </div>
      </form>

      <pre id="planner-output" class="output" aria-live="polite"></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <h3>Ready to make a small, tested change?</h3>
        <p class="muted">We meet you where you are, create simple next steps, and schedule gentle accountability.</p>
        <a href="book.html" class="btn big">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <p class="tiny">Or send a note: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <small>© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Educational integrative services. Not emergency care. For urgent concerns call local emergency services or your provider.</small>
      <nav class="foot-nav">
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
        <a href="terms.html">Terms</a>
        <a href="sitemap.xml">Sitemap</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
